@techstark/opencv-js 5.0.0-release.1 (npm build of OpenCV.js, OpenCV 5.0.0)
Upstream: https://github.com/opencv/opencv
npm package: https://www.npmjs.com/package/@techstark/opencv-js
License: Apache-2.0 (see LICENSE in this directory)

Files:
- opencv.umd.js — official UMD dist (dist/opencv.js from the npm package);
  the WASM binary is inlined in this single file (no separate .wasm needed).
- opencv.js — tiny ESM wrapper: imports the UMD build (which assigns the
  thenable runtime to window.cv) and re-exports the initialized cv object.
